| Keputusan | Pilihan |
|---|---|
| **Database** | PostgreSQL via Docker |
| **Auth (dev)** | Login by email only, no password. Admin: `radstudio@gmail.com` |
| **Auth (future)** | Migrasi ke Google OAuth setelah core app stabil |
| **PRD 2** | Dikerjakan SETELAH seluruh PRD 1 lulus uji |
